Description: |
  The agent engine of prettyplay: step code generation with execution in the loop and failed-check classification, the fixed-form execution routine, the shared classification call carrying the classification user instructions, the error-text policy shared with the executor, and healing with anti-masking and verdicts on terminal failures.
